Package: blackice-traffic
Version: _version_
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6, libglib2.0-0, libnss3, libgl1
Maintainer: Vladislav Ananev <nexus.riot@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: _size_
Description: Simple Network Traffic Visualizer
 Minimal hacker-style network traffic visualizer built with PyQt6. Shows live
 per-interface bandwidth, the sockets this host is listening on, a table of
 remote contacts with reverse-DNS and offline GeoIP, and a world map drawn
 from a bundled coastline outline that needs no network access.
 .
 Ships as a self-contained binary with Python, PyQt6 and all Python
 dependencies bundled; only a few system shared libraries are required.
